---
description: Frontend conventions for Opptra services
globs: frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

Use Vite, React, and TypeScript. Call the API with relative /api paths so the browser and FastAPI stay on one origin.

Product analytics goes through frontend/src/analytics.ts. That function stays a no-op until a tool is chosen.

Do not add Next.js or a second Node server.
